4.MTTR:
“MTTR is the average time taken to restore service after a failure. Lower MTTR indicates faster incident response and 
stronger operational maturity.”

while Customers may tolerate occasional failures, but they expect quick recovery.
“We reduce MTTR through automation, good monitoring, incident runbooks, and post-incident reviews.”
